{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a924ceffdbd0485398ac56ff7c2264b8","id":"pg_6cdc0d5f29b758d6a00ab4640e513603","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/runvendo-vendo-code-of-conduct-md-4d149938d7d3-b4640e513603.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_fffd52f4b8205f0cab4468ae897e094e"],"title":"runvendo/vendo/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md @ 4d149938d7d3","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a924ceffdbd0485398ac56ff7c2264b8"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0439fe278b5f000b295c49b89f010875e5d73395fb216a5a60d5ecc760885200"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Vendo is an embedded agent for B2B SaaS that acts through the host product's own API as the signed-in user and renders generated UI in a sandboxed, brand-native surface without touching host source code."},{"claim_ids":["clm_47af5f31c1074fb53e676ab9da528757714a9f6a157f96390752708f51867b2f"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Cloud-gated features (sharing, publishing, org overlays, pinning) activate with VENDO_API_KEY while the open-source blocks remain self-hosted."},{"claim_ids":["clm_4eb31c13b6105610e0931d75aee87361fa5b49b4650e417becc8e6fe72b56117"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The npm package @vendoai/vendo is the default composition (vendoai is a thin alias), with subpath exports /core and /ui providing shared types/schemas and headless React hooks plus an in-jail component kit."},{"claim_ids":["clm_766686a1a7b330f1e8f970ec65f01190238bddb6f95fb6ee4a849f0269abb820"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Policy, approvals, grants, breakers, and audit sit at one execution choke point; app machines reach host tools only through a guarded tool proxy."},{"claim_ids":["clm_8471d28b3fc8babfa88846d5467c8eb94d234ff4466defc381217d5f026619a3"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Generated components run in an iframe jail with connect-src 'none', escalating to a sandboxed server only when needed."},{"claim_ids":["clm_b50087df7adedc04d45031a8a88eba5e3c09c6827ac7be3b1c0d2704bbb1a532"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"PGlite at .vendo/data serves as the zero-config store, and production runs the same schema on Postgres."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c5639129a9e23d32896f707cc01f258322d3f8d36af5094e9587a83ae588dd84"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Vendo runs a streaming agent that works with any AI SDK LanguageModel, and extracts the host API into tools the agent executes as the signed-in user."},{"claim_ids":["clm_f1fed25b9a55101fb5d39eefb74c7715133c9ba39dcea1e1b6e52d4d9569ebb6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI offers `vendo init` for setup and an optional `vendo doctor` checkup whose printed codes link to exact fixes; a backend package exposes `agent()` and `chat()` without mounting Vendo's CLI or UI."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0439fe278b5f000b295c49b89f010875e5d73395fb216a5a60d5ecc760885200","clm_47af5f31c1074fb53e676ab9da528757714a9f6a157f96390752708f51867b2f","clm_4eb31c13b6105610e0931d75aee87361fa5b49b4650e417becc8e6fe72b56117","clm_766686a1a7b330f1e8f970ec65f01190238bddb6f95fb6ee4a849f0269abb820","clm_8471d28b3fc8babfa88846d5467c8eb94d234ff4466defc381217d5f026619a3","clm_b50087df7adedc04d45031a8a88eba5e3c09c6827ac7be3b1c0d2704bbb1a532","clm_c5639129a9e23d32896f707cc01f258322d3f8d36af5094e9587a83ae588dd84","clm_f1fed25b9a55101fb5d39eefb74c7715133c9ba39dcea1e1b6e52d4d9569ebb6"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a924ceffdbd0485398ac56ff7c2264b8","id":"pg_e4526635cff6536ea93b52dc94dda66e","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/runvendo-vendo-readme-md-4d149938d7d3-52dc94dda66e.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_153217620dfd5e5490a9968c1aaa3b86"],"title":"runvendo/vendo/README.md @ 4d149938d7d3","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a924ceffdbd0485398ac56ff7c2264b8"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_b37db2c05958b89995ff627e90b4134fdc34bbf3ef42e193febae7a0e5c4e0f6"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Telemetry is anonymous and opt-out, build/dev-side only, never firing from a deployed production app; events carry only counts and enums, never source code, paths, prompts, keys, or raw error messages."},{"claim_ids":["clm_dcadf3e9c155c41dfc11e3fc4f6f6ff8dea9e498dc320b2ddde6913ca7f70091"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Telemetry identity is a random UUID stored in ~/.vendo/telemetry.json, and projectIdHash is a salted one-way SHA-256 of the git origin URL or package name, omitted when neither exists."}],"claim_ids":["clm_b37db2c05958b89995ff627e90b4134fdc34bbf3ef42e193febae7a0e5c4e0f6","clm_dcadf3e9c155c41dfc11e3fc4f6f6ff8dea9e498dc320b2ddde6913ca7f70091"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:55Z","created_by_operation":"op_a924ceffdbd0485398ac56ff7c2264b8","id":"pg_fcd3e529a65256449b611c2b7a83f1b1","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/runvendo-vendo-telemetry-md-4d149938d7d3-1c2b7a83f1b1.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_0a2043ae06255e78ade91b262b78c8f4"],"title":"runvendo/vendo/TELEMETRY.md @ 4d149938d7d3","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:37:55Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a924ceffdbd0485398ac56ff7c2264b8"}
